<mxCell id="p815" value="LMSYS post (1 Jul 2024, GPT-4 Turbo vs Mixtral 8x7B, best reported routers at 95% of GPT-4): &gt;85% cheaper on MT Bench, 45% MMLU, 35% GSM8K; the abstract says &gt;2× in certain cases. A route change must re-fit the prompt to the target window — never let the provider truncate the policy." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="292" width="820" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
