<mxCell id="p1222" value="0.50 GiB KV for a 4,096-token Llama 3 8B prefix. A shared system prompt belongs in the first; a customer&#x27;s order status belongs in the second only behind a key that includes that customer. Do not compare a hit rate with the $4,608 prefix saving." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="330" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
