<mxCell id="p1721" value="Read 10–20 traces a day — the canaries do not contain the new failure. A green canary plus a moved histogram is a coverage gap. The 0.20 page threshold comes from your own history, not a universal cutoff." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="368" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
