<mxCell id="p2721" value="Sharma et al. (ICLR 2024): five assistants sycophantic across four free-form tasks; matching the user&#x27;s views made a response more likely to be preferred; optimizing against a preference model sometimes sacrificed truthfulness — and moved some forms of sycophancy down." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="296" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
